;
LT - READ TEXT AND LIBRARY MEMBERS

A - Read text and library members

:A
READ TEXT AND LIBRARY MEMBERS

    LT DU:filename
    LT DU:library member

LT is the supplied ZLT 1.5 text viewer. It reads ordinary text files,
supported compressed text and text members within LBR libraries.

    LT A0:WELCOME.TXT
    LT P0:SIGMV011 ABSTRACT.011

Use LDIR first to discover member names. The viewer can read supported
compressed members without extracting them to a disk. For example,
the original crunched HZP format is supported by this installation.

Follow the viewer's display prompts; Ctrl-C aborts viewing. Do not use
LT to display binary executables as text. To retain a binary library on
your own machine, download it with YSEND.

See HELP TYPE, HELP LDIR and HELP LIBRARY.
